message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LLM Buddy: A Computer-Aided Method Engineering Tool for LLM-Augmented Research"
type: software
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-03-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/avigi25/LLM-Buddy"
url: "https://github.com/avigi25/LLM-Buddy"
abstract: >-
  A Computer-Aided Method Engineering (CAME) tool for documenting
  LLM-augmented research through prompt-centric auditable development.
  LLM Buddy captures prompts and responses from all major LLM services
  via a Chrome extension, HTTPS proxy, Claude Desktop MCP integration,
  or manual entry, and stores them in a unified local database alongside
  file associations, auto-backups, and research session metadata.
keywords:
  - design science research
  - large language models
  - prompt management
  - research transparency
  - promptware engineering
  - eADR
  - computer-aided method engineering
